\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c) & =\\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325483 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325484 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325485 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325486 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325487 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1041 "selection" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325485 13194139534994 true] [17592186325482 1110 #uuid "7103bd9a-dd65-5ef5-a508-8b8340f8acc6" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325483 1034 "-\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325483 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325483 1111 #uuid "95bdd564-5852-571f-a336-ee429eb3aa63" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325484 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325484 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325484 1111 #uuid "416f30c9-011b-59f1-8040-bfda6da11b9a" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325485 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325485 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325485 1111 #uuid "ec7a6c59-cbb6-57d2-ba83-d418e738b7b7" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325486 1034 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325486 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325486 1111 #uuid "da2e7952-3ee9-5e6f-b80b-46050f955d0d" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325487 1034 "-\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325487 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325487 1111 #uuid "ab90d642-1c79-5806-adf1-31cb6141d483" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325489 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1089 "q-317302" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1100 "Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ given that $a=⟨\\sqrt{7},-2,5⟩$ and $b\\times c=⟨\\sqrt{7},3,-1⟩.$\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1113 #uuid "1e96fc98-4911-5113-ab88-6925162a0a47" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325488 1145 "Substituting given vectors into the formula for the scalar triple product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨\\sqrt{7},-2,5⟩\\cdot ⟨\\sqrt{7},3,-1⟩ \\\\  & =(\\sqrt{7})(\\sqrt{7})+(-2)(3)+(5)(-1) \\\\  & =7-6-5 \\\\  & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325489 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325490 13194139534994 true] [17592186325489 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534994 true] [17592186325489 1041 "field-1" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325489 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325490 13194139534994 true] [17592186325489 1110 #uuid "365eded9-c6b0-5308-b4dd-28f04dbd12ce" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325490 1034 "-4" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325490 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325490 1111 #uuid "f04a743f-843d-5a0f-b8c0-a4589a3b9158" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325492 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1089 "q-317304" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1100 "Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ given that $a=⟨0,\\,5,\\,\\sqrt{11}⟩$ and $b\\times c=⟨7,\\,-2,\\,\\sqrt{11}⟩.$\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1113 #uuid "f8084faa-c83e-5fad-abf5-bedd210fd50c" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325491 1145 "Substituting given vectors into the formula for the scalar triple product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨0,\\,5,\\,\\sqrt{11}⟩\\cdot ⟨7,\\,-2,\\,\\sqrt{11}⟩ \\\\  & =(0)(7)+(5)(-2)+(\\sqrt{11})(\\sqrt{11}) \\\\  & =0-10+11 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325493 13194139534994 true] [17592186325492 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 131941395