 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325496 1111 #uuid "e1ed1115-a6c4-56a4-bdd3-321959029acf" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325498 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1089 "q-317319" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1100 "Let $a=⟨2,1,3⟩$, $b=⟨1,4,0⟩$ and $c=⟨6,-1,2⟩.$ Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ using a determinant.\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1113 #uuid "57d195f2-409b-5b85-9dc0-07acb5129669" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325497 1145 "Remember that the scalar triple product $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ is just the determinant of the matrix whose rows are given by $a,$ $b,$ and $c.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|\\,-\\,1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}|\\,+\\,3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\,(4\\cdot 2-0\\cdot (-1))\\,-\\,1\\,(1\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 6)\\,+\\,3\\,(1\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 6) \\\\  & =2\\,(8)\\,-\\,1\\,(2)\\,+\\,3\\,(-25) \\\\  & =16-2-75 \\\\  & =-61.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325499 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325500 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1041 "field-1" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325500 13194139534994 true] [17592186325498 1110 #uuid "219e93a6-8a1d-5bd2-8a85-573a14d9975d" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325499 1034 "61" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325499 1111 #uuid "343e78a7-96a6-5858-bb16-a9baff5872dd" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325500 1034 "-61" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325500 1111 #uuid "d9ea412a-ac59-54dc-a0f3-117c08a84eb2" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325501 1034 "-9" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325501 1111 #uuid "80757b26-c636-5750-8f74-753e22c144e2" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325503 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1089 "q-317343" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1100 "Find $b\\cdot (c\\times a),$ if $b\\times c=⟨4,-1,6⟩$ and $a=⟨2,3,-1⟩.$\n\n$b\\cdot (c\\times a)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1113 #uuid "e1f1473a-4a24-51a0-9ef9-8abd69416c51" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325502 1145 "First, we compute the triple scalar product \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨2,3,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨4,-1,6⟩ \\\\  & =2\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =8-3-6 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (c\\times a)=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325504 13194139534994 true] [17592186325503 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534994 true] [17592186325503 1041 "field-1" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325503 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325504 13194139534994 true] [17592186325503 1110 #uuid "7bbda927-e36e-56a1-b2b5-82057a775df9" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325504 1034 "-1" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325504 1111 #uuid "cb436df1-fc5e-5aa3-b304-7ae429d09dd4" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1017 #edb/ref 17592186325506 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1089 "q-73458" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1100 "Given that $a=⟨-2,4,3⟩,$ $b=⟨-1,3,2⟩,$ and $c=⟨2,-1,4⟩,$ find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ using the definition of the scalar triple product." 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1113 #uuid "6d564fbe-e6b5-5480-8918-6d6776762bbd" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325505 1145 "First, we find the cross product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\times c & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3\\cdot 4-2\\cdot (-1))i-((-1)\\cdot 4-2\\cdot 2)j+((-1)\\cdot (-1)-3\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =14i+8j-5k \\\\  & =⟨14,8,-5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can compute the scalar triple product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨-2,4,3⟩\\cdot ⟨14,8,-5⟩ \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot 14+4\\cdot 8+3\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =-11.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325507 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325508 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325509 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325510 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325511 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1041 "selection" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325507 13194139534994 true] [17592186325506 1110 #uuid "5058bb6e-7250-5d26-8ec4-d5b0a463e069" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325507 1034 "-11" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325507 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325507 1111 #uuid "4e729854-4bf1-5961-beb3-ba1a72b2c6d7" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325508 1034 "-15" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [17592186325508 1111 #uuid "d09e15a4-7c13-568e-a570-fc9e3902259d" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325509 1034 "28" 13194139534994 true] [17592186325509 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534994 true] [175921863255